<figure class="pgx-figure" data-restore-figure aria-label="A dump needs extension software at its destination">
 <figcaption><span>Figure 4</span> A dump needs extension software at its destination</figcaption>
 <div class="pgx-options"><label>Target software <select data-software><option value="ready">Compatible files provisioned</option><option value="missing">Extension files missing</option></select></label></div>
 <div class="pgx-scene">
  <div class="pgx-two"><div class="pgx-card"><strong>Source database</strong><p>btree_gist objects</p><p>7001 + room_free + grants</p></div><div class="pgx-card"><strong>Source server installation</strong><p>Control file · SQL scripts · library</p><p>Outside the logical dump</p></div></div>
  <p class="pgx-arrow">↓ pg_dump · database definitions and data</p>
  <div class="pgx-card pgx-dump"><strong>Logical dump</strong><p>CREATE EXTENSION btree_gist …</p><p>Table · row 7001 · exclusion rule · grants</p><p>No extension library or member-by-member definitions</p></div>
  <p class="pgx-arrow">↓ restore · install extension before dependent objects</p>
  <div class="pgx-two"><div class="pgx-card"><strong>Target database</strong><p data-target-state data-live>Empty before restore</p></div><div class="pgx-card"><strong>Target server installation</strong><p data-target-files data-live>Compatible control file, scripts and library</p></div></div>
  <p class="pgx-result" data-restore-result data-live>Rows and software have separate routes to the target.</p>
  <p data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">The source has both extension objects in the database and supporting files in the server installation.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="pgx-controls" role="group" aria-label="Figure 4 playback"><button data-play>Play</button><button data-back>Back</button><button data-next>Next</button><button data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step>1 / 4</span><div data-hold><span></span></div></div>
 <p class="pgx-caption">A logical-restore model. The successful native rehearsal used separate PostgreSQL 18.6 clusters sharing the same provisioned software. That tests reconstruction and behaviour, without establishing recovery on a differently provisioned host.</p>
 <details><summary>All stages, as text</summary><ol><li>The source database uses btree_gist’s objects; server files supply the implementation.</li><li>The dump requests extension creation and carries application definitions and data. It does not carry the extension’s software.</li><li>Compatible files let the target create the extension before restoring its dependants. Missing files stop that creation.</li><li>After success, check the caller’s read, range predicates, refused 7002 and permitted 7003. Rows alone do not establish a recovered reservation service.</li></ol></details>
</figure>
<script>
import {stepper} from '../figures/stepper.mjs';
for(const root of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-restore-figure]')) {
 const select=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-software]')!;
 const player=stepper(root,{steps:()=>4,draw:(step:number)=>{
  const ready=select.value==='ready';root.querySelector('[data-target-files]')!.textContent=ready?'Compatible control file, scripts and library':'No btree_gist control file, scripts or library';
  root.querySelector('[data-target-state]')!.textContent=step<2?'Empty before restore':ready?(step===2?'Extension + table + 7001 + rule + grants restored':'Caller reads 7001; 7002 refused; 7003 permitted'):'CREATE EXTENSION cannot complete';
  root.querySelector('[data-restore-result]')!.textContent=step<2?'Rows and software have separate routes to the target.':ready?(step===2?'Objects and rows reconstructed':'Behaviour checked under the caller’s authority'):'Restore cannot supply the missing software';
  root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=['The source has both extension objects in the database and supporting files in the server installation.','pg_dump records how to recreate the extension and its application dependants. Copying this dump does not provision the server.',ready?'The target finds compatible extension files. Extension creation supplies its members; application definitions and rows can follow.':'The extension name in the dump cannot create files that are absent from the server. Stop and repair target provisioning.',ready?'Exercise the restored service: check stored values, operator results, constraint refusals and ordinary caller access.':'There is no complete recovered service to test. An ignored restore error would leave the acceptance question unanswered.'][step];
 }});select.addEventListener('change',()=>player.render());
}
</script>
